The financial-data modules under src/open_trading_agents/dataflows and the
financial-tool behavior in src/open_trading_agents/tools.py, and benchmark/return
window semantics in src/open_trading_agents/memory.py are adapted from
TradingAgents. Financial role instructions in src/open_trading_agents/prompts.py
and decision field behavior also derive from the reference project.
Report grouping and HTML presentation in reporting.py and report_html.py are
adapted from the corresponding TradingAgents report modules.
Modifications include independent configuration, package imports,
typing, documentation, local MCP tool exposure, and removal of graph-framework
coupling. No upstream telemetry, update checks, or direct model clients are included.
